 "desc": "Concert grand (Yamaha C5, Salamander), 4 velocity layers pp/mp/mf/f, full 88 keys A0-C8, stereo, natural decay. Classical/solo piano, sonatas, ballads, chords and melody; velocity shapes tone. | Playable MIDI 21-108 (A0-C8), 4 velocity layers crossfaded. Params: pedal=1 lets notes ring until the next chord (sustain pedal, re-pedals on each new note); human 0-1 adds timing/level life; velcurve <1.6 = soft notes louder; bright = velocity opens tone; keytrack = high notes brighter.",
